	| Status        | ACTIVE                         |
	| Complimentary | false                          |
	When I select the following licenses under the licenses tab on the subscription details page
	| Perlic - ${staticProjectName} |
	Then I should not be able to view the replace button for all licenses under the license tab on the subscription details page
