	| Header  | Perlic - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Product | DXP Production                | |
	When I click on the deactivate button for the license in position "1" on the license page
	Then I should be able to view the following license values on the license page
	| Header        | Perlic - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Product       | DXP Production                | |
	| Status        | DEACTIVATED                   | |
	When I log out and log into the provisioning homepage as "licensing.contact.worker@liferay.com.broken" with password "${staticProvisioningQaUserPassword}"
	And I update my password upon login to "test"
	And I go to the license index page
	And I search the licenses page using the keyword "${staticAccountKey}"
	And I click on the license with the keyword "Perlic - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	Then I should be able to view the following license values on the license page
	| Header        | Perlic - ${staticProjectName} | |
